# reset-click (H5): a's reset clicked (254, 450) — the box shows 1.00, the
# reset and Reset all are gone (their slots kept), the hash drops a.
# Behaviour: views.json URL line has no a; the DOM shows value 1.00 and no
# reset button in a's row.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
query a=2
wait 2000
click 254 450
wait 300
shot reset-click
